# Documentation For Lumen

## Booting The Library

Use this loader to fetch the library from GitHub:

```lua
local Lumen = loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/siabheng/Sentinal-Interface-Suite/refs/heads/main/source.lua", true))()
```

> This loads the library so you can create windows and interface elements.

